{"unit_id": "tag:033R:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nEGA 并未在显著位置给出本节所讨论的概念的定义。\n<REF_0001>提及并定义了“普遍日本型（universally Japanese）概形（scheme）”。<REF_0002>提及了“日本型（Japanese）概形（scheme）”，但没有给出定义。\n永田（Nagata）概形（scheme）（定义见下文）见于文献中的少数几处（例如<REF_0003>和<REF_0004>）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n我们简要回顾如下定义。称整环（domain）<MATH_0001>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>日本型（Japanese）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果<MATH_0002>在其分式域（fraction field）的任意有限扩张（finite extension）中的整闭包（integral closure）在<MATH_0003>上是有限的（finite）。称环（ring）<MATH_0004>为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>普遍日本型（universally Japanese）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果对于任意有限型（finite type）环同态（ring map）<MATH_0005>，只要<MATH_0006>是整环（domain），<MATH_0007>就是日本型（Japanese）的。称环（ring）<MATH_0008>为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>永田（Nagata）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>环，如果它是诺特（Noetherian）的，且<MATH_0009>是日本型（Japanese）的（对任取的素理想（prime）<MATH_0010>均如此，其中该素理想取自<MATH_0011>）。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["EGA"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "universally Japanese", "target_term": "普遍日本型"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Japanese", "target_term": "日本型"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Nagata", "target_term": "永田"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "domain", "target_term": "整环"}, {"source_term": "Japanese", "target_term": "日本型"}, {"source_term": "fraction field", "target_term": "分式域"}, {"source_term": "finite extension", "target_term": "有限扩张"}, {"source_term": "integral closure", "target_term": "整闭包"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限的"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "universally Japanese", "target_term": "普遍日本型"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "domain", "target_term": "整环"}, {"source_term": "Japanese", "target_term": "日本型"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "Nagata", "target_term": "永田"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "