{"unit_id": "tag:033T:statement", "translation": "在<REF_0001>中，称（局部诺特（locally Noetherian））概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>为日本型（Japanese），如果对每个<MATH_0002>以及每个关联素理想（associated prime）<MATH_0003>（取自<MATH_0004>），环（ring）<MATH_0005>都是日本型（Japanese）的。我们不采用这个定义，因为存在一个一维（one dimensional）诺特整环（Noetherian domain），其局部环（local rings）都是优良的（excellent）（特别是日本型（Japanese）的），而该整环的正规化（normalization）并非有限的（finite）。见<REF_0002>或<REF_0003>或<REF_0004>。\n另一方面，可以如下定义，以避开这个问题。称概形（scheme）<MATH_0006>为日本型（Japanese），如果对每个仿射开（affine open）集<MATH_0007>，环（ring）<MATH_0008>对于任一关联素理想（associated prime）<MATH_0009>（取自<MATH_0010>）都是日本型（Japanese）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Japanese", "target_term": "日本型"}, {"source_term": "associated prime", "target_term": "关联素理想"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "Japanese", "target_term": "日本型"}, {"source_term": "one dimensional", "target_term": "一维"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian domain", "target_term": "诺特整环"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "excellent", "target_term": "优良的"}, {"source_term": "Japanese", "target_term": "日本型"}, {"source_term": "normalization", "target_term": "正规化"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限的"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Japanese", "target_term": "日本型"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "associated prime", "target_term": "关联素理想"}, {"source_term": "Japanese", "target_term": "日本型"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "文献定义所涉及的局部性质"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "文献中的定义对象"}, {"source_term": "Japanese", "target_term": "日本型", "context": "文献所定义的概形性质"}, {"source_term": "associated prime", "target_term": "关联素理想", "context": "文献定义中量化的素理想"}, {"sour