{"unit_id": "tag:0HA2:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们指出，环（ring）<MATH_0001>是 G 环（ring），如果<MATH_0002>是诺特（Noetherian）的，且对每个素（prime）理想（ideal）<MATH_0003>（取自<MATH_0004>），环同态（ring map）<MATH_0005>都是正则的（regular）。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["G"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "所讨论的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "带有 G 限定的环"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "G 环的第一个条件"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素", "context": "所量化理想的素性"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "所量化的对象"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "条件中所考察的同态"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则的", "context": "该环同态所满足的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0HA3:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。称<MATH_0002>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>G 概形（G-scheme）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>这个术语可能并不通行。如果<MATH_0003>是有限群（finite group）或群概形（group scheme），那么<MATH_0004>-概形（scheme）有时指带有<MATH_0005>的作用（action）的概形（scheme）。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>，如果对每个<MATH_0006>，都存在仿射开（affine open）邻域（neighbourhood）<MATH_0007>，使得环（ring）<MATH_0008>是 G 环（ring）（见《代数（Algebra）补编》中的定义<REF_0001>）。\n", "allowed_english": ["G"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "G-scheme", "target_term": "G 概形"}, {"source_term": "finite group", "target_term": "有限群"}, {"source_term": "group scheme", "target_term": "群概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "action", "target_term": "作用"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义所讨论的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "G-scheme", "target_term": "G 概形", "context": "正在引入的概形术语"}, {"source_term": "finite group", "target_term": "有限群", "context": "脚注中出现的一类作用对象"}, {"source_term": "group scheme", "target_term": "群概形", "context": "脚注中出现的另一类作用对象"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "脚注说明的带作用概形术语"}, {"source_term": "action", "target_term": "作用", "context": "脚注所说的概形附加结构"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "脚注所说的承载作用的对象"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "定义中邻域的性质"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "定义中存在的邻域"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "所取邻域对应的环"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "带有 G 限定的环"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引用章节名称中