{"unit_id": "tag:0HA4:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0002>是 G 概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0003>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的，且对所有<MATH_0004>，环同态（ring map）<MATH_0005>都是正则的（regular）。\n<STRUCT_0004><MATH_0006>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的，且对任一闭点（closed point）<MATH_0007>，环同态（ring map）<MATH_0008>都是正则的（regular）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": ["G"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则的"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所讨论的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "所列条件间的关系"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "首个条件中的带 G 限定的对象"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "第二个条件中的局部性质"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "第二个条件中任意点所对应的同态"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则的", "context": "第二个条件对环同态的要求"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "第三个条件中的局部性质"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "第三个条件所量化的点"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "第三个条件中闭点所对应的同态"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则的", "context": "第三个条件对环同态的要求"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0HA4:proof", "translation": "显然，（1）推出（2），而（2）推出（3）。\n假设（3）成立。设<MATH_0001>为任意一点（point）。由引理<REF_0001>，存在一个特化（specialization）<MATH_0002>，使得<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>中是闭的（closed）。于是<MATH_0005>是 G 环（ring）（由《代数（Algebra）补编》中的引理<REF_0002>）。由于<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>在某个素（prime）理想（ideal）处的局部化（localization）（《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0003>），可知<MATH_0008>是正则的（regular）环同态（ring map）。由于<MATH_0009>是任取的，可得对任一仿射开（affine open）集<MATH_0010>，其诺特（Noetherian）环（ring）（见引理<REF_0004>）<MATH_0011>是 G 环（ring）。这就证明了（1）成立。\n", "allowed_english": ["G"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特化"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭的"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则的"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "证明开始时所取的任意点"}, {"source_term": "specialization", "target_term": "特化", "context": "由所引引理得到的特化关系"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭的", "context": "所取特化点的性质"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "由引理得到的带 G 限定的环"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引用章节名称中的学科名称"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素", "context": "所用局部化对应理想的性质"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "进行局部化所用的理想"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化", "context": "所考察的两个环之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所引用引理所在的章节名称"}, {"source