{"unit_id": "tag:0HA5:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>是 G 概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0003>对于每个仿射开（affine open）集<MATH_0003>，环（ring）<MATH_0004>都是 G 环（ring）。\n<STRUCT_0004>存在仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，使得每个<MATH_0006>都是 G 环（ring）。\n<STRUCT_0005>存在开（open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>，使得每个开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0008>都是 G 概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n此外，如果<MATH_0009>是 G 概形（scheme），则每个开子概形（open subscheme）都是 G 概形（scheme）。\n", "allowed_english": ["G"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所讨论的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "所列条件间的关系"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "首个条件中的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "首个条件中带 G 限定的概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "第二个条件中量化的开集"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "仿射开集对应的环"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "第二个条件中带 G 限定的环"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "co